Code is adapted from the following Apache-2.0 projects. Each adapted file is
listed with its source path and commit; the file itself carries a
"Derived from <repo>@<sha>:<path>" line.

Adapted files:
- dfrunner/src/main.rs
  Derived from datafusion-contrib/datafusion-distributed@ee3eacd93af66e4ef2e2e72a253842c723f92ca5:benchmarks/remote-worker/src/main.rs
  (HTTP query endpoint, shared SessionContext with the Iceberg integration,
  abort-on-drop query task, mimalloc allocator)
- queries/tpcds/*.sql (all but q03, q07, q55) and queries/overrides/datafusion/tpcds/*.sql
  Derived from trinodb/trino@aab079cf8741f88001ecfeb0e46ce0841eac5f29:testing/trino-benchmark-queries/src/main/resources/sql/trino/tpcds/<id>.sql
  (TPC-DS query text in Trino's dialect; table prefix and a few column aliases changed,
  as each file's header says)
- queries/tpch/q02.sql, q04.sql, q05.sql, q07.sql to q22.sql
  Derived from apache/datafusion@36f393559620235c250f68727e3243cc7f429db8:benchmarks/queries/q<N>.sql
  (TPC-H query text; table names prefixed, q04 date literal, q15 view as a WITH query)

- dfrunner/src/sail_join_reorder/ (all files)
  Derived from lakehq/sail@86dea385943c785b38d85479755589d193f989d3:crates/sail-physical-optimizer/src/join_reorder/
  (Sail's JoinReorder physical optimizer rule; built only into the `sail` dfrunner
  variant, engines df-sail and df-sail-cs. Changes are listed at the top of mod.rs.)
- dfrunner/patches/datafusion-55.0.0-pr24456.patch
  Derived from apache/datafusion pull request #24456 (Dandandan/datafusion branch
  perf/join-order-enumeration, head 472e83e1289eec0b482a5b3d4d0dc1f5140fe878), diffed
  against its merge base 242b96c231636b5738125678a83197896a5cc64b and adapted to
  DataFusion 55.0.0 (the patch header lists the changes). Applied to DataFusion 55.0.0
  sources at build time for the `jo` dfrunner variant (engines df-jo and df-jo-cs).

Libraries used by dfrunner (dependencies, not copied code): Apache DataFusion,
datafusion-distributed and datafusion-distributed-iceberg, Apache Iceberg Rust
(iceberg, iceberg-catalog-rest, iceberg-storage-opendal), apache/datafusion-iceberg.
Exact revisions: versions.lock.yaml and dfrunner/Cargo.lock.

Sources:

- datafusion-contrib/datafusion-distributed (https://github.com/datafusion-contrib/datafusion-distributed)
- apache/datafusion (https://github.com/apache/datafusion)
- lakehq/sail (https://github.com/lakehq/sail)
- trinodb/trino (https://github.com/trinodb/trino)
- ClickHouse/ClickBench (https://github.com/ClickHouse/ClickBench)

